  "id": "ex-06-nebensatzkonnektoren-b2",
  "intro": "Standalone drill set, not tied to any lesson. Closes out the Nebensatzkonnektoren topic with six advanced connectors: je … desto (the je-clause is verb-final, the desto-clause has normal Verb-Zweit with desto+comparative in position 1); indem (method — \"by doing X\") vs. sodass (result — \"with the consequence that\"), easy to mix up since both translate loosely as \"so that\" in English; falls/sofern (both \"if/provided that\", falls more everyday, sofern more formal); and es sei denn (\"unless\"), which — unlike every other connector here — is followed by a normal Verb-Zweit clause, not a Nebensatz. Blocks: A Basistraining → B Vertiefung → C Sprachbausteine → D Wiederholung — a full-topic mix. Answers in solutions.md.\n",
  "lesson": "EX/06-nebensatzkonnektoren-b2",
  "level": "B2",
  "summary": null,
  "title": "je … desto, indem, sodass, falls, sofern, es sei denn — B2",
